+4. In review mode, test both universal product quality and the WIGTN contract in the review checklist. In deep-dive mode, distinguish facts, inferences, and open questions.
+5. Save under the project’s docs convention, or default to `docs/product/<feature>-prd.md`. Preserve source documents unless asked to edit them.
 
